class_name CrookedMoonCampaign
extends CampaignModule
## The Crooked Moon's answers to the story engine (CampaignModule, named in data/campaign.json). Empty on purpose: the base
## class answers for a game with no reading, no watching villain, ordinary spells and no ending of its own, which is what
## the foundation needs. Plan G1 fills it in: the Fated Tarot, the ritual track and the Crooked Moon's gaze, Adela's
## visions as the oracle, the endings, the parley before the Born King, fight barks, defeat text and achievements.
